msgid ""
"The February Newsletter has been published! This month, you can find an "
"introduction to the new Quarkus Superheroes sample application as well as "
"articles teaching you how to get started with Stork Service Discovery, Java "
"Asynchronous Programming with Java, Distributed tracing with Istio, Quarkus "
"and Jaeger, Monitoring Quarkus Prometheus and Grafana, and how to create a "
"Quarkus extension for AWS Cloudwatch. Of course it includes selected Quarkus "
"Insights podcast videos, top tweets, and the latest community events around "
"Quarkus."
msgstr ""

msgid "Check out https://quarkus.io/newsletter/17/[Newsletter #17]!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Want to get newsletters in your inbox? https://quarkus.io/newsletter[Sign up "
"for the newsletter] using the on page form."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We've also included the list of the newest found online stories. Give it a "
"read and if you feel something is missing or have an article coming out for "
"future Quarkus Newsletter install the https://github.com/quarkusio/"
"url2quarkuspub[bookmarklet] on your laptop and phone to easily submit a "
"story. If you prefer the manual way please https://github.com/quarkusio/"
"quarkusio.github.io/issues[open an issue] with a short description and a url."
""
msgstr ""
